    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) Arusha Campus recently concluded a highly successful two-day leadership training, significantly strengthening community-based savings groups operating under the Village Savings and Loan Association (VSLA) methodology. Held in November, at the AKU Community Outreach Centre, the programme brought together 61 dedicated participants, surpassing the original target of 60, including nine Village Agents and 52 Group Leaders.",
